Principal Residence Exemption
Exempts an eligible principal residence from up to 18 mills of local school operating tax.
Local assessor; Form 2368.
It does not exempt the property from every millage or charge.
PRE Rescission
Removes PRE when the property no longer qualifies.
Local assessor; Form 2602.
