Qualified Agricultural Exemption
Can exempt qualifying agricultural property from certain school operating millage.
Local assessor; classification and Form 2599 rules.
Agricultural appearance alone does not prove qualification.
Summer Tax Deferment
Allows qualifying taxpayers to postpone summer taxes without additional penalty or interest when all deadlines are met.
Local treasurer; Form 471.
This changes the payment date; it does not erase the tax.
Principal Residence Exemption steps
Confirm ownership and occupancy
