PRE is not the Homestead Property Tax Credit.
PRE affects local school operating millage on the property tax bill. The Homestead Property Tax Credit is claimed through the individual income-tax process when eligible.
Appealing a PRE denial
A denial issued by a local assessor or county official generally must be appealed to the Michigan Tax Tribunal within 35 days of the denial date. A denial issued by the Michigan Department of Treasury generally follows a separate 35-day Treasury appeal route shown in the notice.
Use the notice date immediately.
